            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuk’ ubgenge n’ugutahura urabihawe, kandi nzoguha n’ubutunzi n’ibintu n’icubahiro bitīgeze kugirwa n’umwami n’umwe mu bākwitangiye imbere, kandi no mu bazoguherukira nta wuzogira ibihwanye n’ivyawe.",
          "type": "text",
